id: S12
target: src/sello/scalar.nim
desc: recodeScalarRadix16: digit-range constant changed, carry-formation offset '(result[i] + 8) shr 4' -> '(result[i] + 9) shr 4', shifting the signed-digit recentering point.
====OLD====
    carry = (result[i] + 8) shr 4
====NEW====
    carry = (result[i] + 9) shr 4
====END====
